{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792083240, "covers_from": "2026-10-15T16:54:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-15T16:55:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792083300, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-15T16:54:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 65371, "sprite_key": "bear_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "勞工", "content": "勞工福利越來越好基本薪資逐年提升，既有員工薪水卻無法改變，隨著通膨變得越來越窮很心酸，期望也能被照顧", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.65,371", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T16:54:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35597, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "育兒", "content": "營養午餐和重要，但不需完全免費。負擔一點可以讓孩子更健康滿意，家長會贊同的", "display_name": "信義代表 No.35,597", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T16:54:27+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34660, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "觀光", "content": "希望更多的外國人知道台灣好！", "display_name": "北投代表 No.34,660", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T16:54:32+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2136, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "平面人行道不知道在幹嘛，機車跟汽車沒有在管的，都直接騎上去", "display_name": "北投代表 No.2,136", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T16:54:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 19, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 15819, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "公館羅斯福路左轉基隆路，機車跟汽車擠在同一線上等待，沒有畫機車專用左轉道，真的太危險了。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.15,819", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 35597, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.35,597", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 34660, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.34,660", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position"